### MODEL (turn 4)
The balance sheet bug was in `ledger/reports.py`: retained earnings were computed as `income + expense`, which gives the negative of profit because income is stored as credits. I changed it to `-(income + expense)`, so profit and loss now flow into equity with the correct sign. All 3 tests pass, including the balance sheet test that checks assets against equity after sales and expenses.
